{"questions":[{"question_id":"HqcWB0vxNbRkE7rF","paperTitle":"JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 2 Offline","year":2013,"examDate":2013,"subject":"chemistry","chapter":"chemical-equilibrium","chapterGroup":"physical-chemistry","topic":"chemical-equilibrium-law-of-mass-action-and-equilibrium-constant","type":"mcqm","marks":3,"negMarks":0.75,"permalink":"the-thermal-dissociation-equilibrium-of-caco3s-is-studied-2013-marks-3-hqcwb0vxnbrke7rf.htm","content":"The thermal dissociation equilibrium of CaCO<sub>3</sub>(s) is studied under different conditions<br>\n<br>CaCO<sub>3</sub>(s) <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.032ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.195ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -514 1000 528\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"21CB\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-21CB\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> CaO(s) + CO<sub>2</sub>(g).<br><br> For this equilibrium, the correct statement(s) is (are)","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.894ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1721 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is dependent on T"},{"identifier":"B","content":"K is independent of the initial amount of CaCO<sub>3</sub>"},{"identifier":"C","content":"K is dependent on the pressure of CO<sub>2</sub> at a given T"},{"identifier":"D","content":"<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.894ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 1721 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(833,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> is independent of catalyst, if any"}],"correct_options":["A","B","D"],"explanation":"<p>The thermal decomposition of limestone (CaCO<sub>3</sub>) is represented as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"49.906ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 22058.2 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\" transform=\"translate(1222,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1944,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3158.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(3547.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(3941.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4608.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"21CC\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-V-21CC\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5886.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"61\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-61\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(1222,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(7886.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(8275.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"73\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-73\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(8669.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(9280.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(10280.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(12217.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(12606.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"67\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-67\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13106.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(13495.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(13939.8,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(866,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(15174.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(16202.5,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(17258.2,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">positive</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>The reaction is endothermic, meaning it requires heat to proceed.</p>\n\n<p>(i) The forward reaction is endothermic (ΔH &gt; 0), indicating heat absorption, while the reverse reaction is exothermic (ΔH &lt; 0), indicating heat release.</p>\n\n<p>Therefore, increasing the temperature will favor the forward reaction, leading to more CaCO<sub>3</sub> dissociation. Conversely, decreasing the temperature will favor the reverse reaction. Option (A) is correct.</p>\n\n<p>The equilibrium constant (K) varies with temperature but does not depend on the concentration of any species in an aqueous solution or the pressure of gases such as CO<sub>2</sub>. Option (B) is correct.</p>\n\n<p>(ii) The equilibrium constant (K) for the reaction is expressed as:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.566ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"11.759ex\" height=\"2.262ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 5197.6 1000\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1649.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2705.1,0)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2983.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4919.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-5D\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Because CaCO<sub>3</sub> and CaO are solids, their concentrations do not affect the equilibrium constant. Option (B) is correct.</p>\n\n<p>(iii) At a given temperature, the equilibrium constant in terms of pressure (K<sub>P</sub>) depends on the vapour pressure of CO<sub>2</sub>.</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.579ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.881ex\" height=\"2.125ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -683 4809.4 939.1\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"50\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-50\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1620.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2676.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"50\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-50\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(714,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>The equilibrium constant (K<sub>C</sub>) also depends on the pressure of CO<sub>2</sub>:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.579ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.73ex\" height=\"2.546ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -869.3 8720.8 1125.4\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1649.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(2705.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"50\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-50\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(714,-150) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use><use data-c=\"4F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4F\" transform=\"translate(722,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1533,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4838.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"28\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-28\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(5227.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"52\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-52\"></use><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\" transform=\"translate(736,0)\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(6685.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"29\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-29\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(422,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1611,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>Option (C) is correct.</p>\n\n<p>The temperature dependence of the Arrhenius constant is given by:</p>\n\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.469ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22.99ex\" height=\"4.07ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1149.5 10161.5 1799\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"6C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6C\"></use><use data-c=\"6E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-6E\" transform=\"translate(278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(834,0)\"><use data-c=\"2061\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2061\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1000.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,446.1) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"4B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-4B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(811,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1058.8\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2577.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(3633,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,451.6) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(866,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1234.9,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(661.6,-345) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"52\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-52\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1603.5\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(5476.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"5B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-5B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(472,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(452.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1019.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1953.4,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(2953.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(452.8,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"54\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-54\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(755,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g><rect width=\"1019.2\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(4212.9,0) translate(0 -0.5)\"><use data-c=\"5D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-LO-5D\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n\n<p>(iv) A catalyst alters the activation energy of the reaction, thus affecting its speed. However, it does not change the enthalpy or heat of the reactants and products. As a result, the enthalpy of the reaction (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.357ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"4.803ex\" height=\"1.977ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 2122.9 873.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"394\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-394\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(866,-150) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D45F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45F\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1234.9,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43B\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>) remains unchanged. Option (D) is correct.</p>\n\n<img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1lzoxo3z8/dc5de08c-4009-4b2a-b7e3-a6863707a93b/ab8f4730-5787-11ef-8c18-492e14d7f200/file-jaoe38c1lzoxo3z9.png?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1lzoxo3z8/dc5de08c-4009-4b2a-b7e3-a6863707a93b/ab8f4730-5787-11ef-8c18-492e14d7f200/file-jaoe38c1lzoxo3z9.png\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:b